OL,3,GNEWSAPilot died when plane crashed on
OL,4,Atake-off - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old pilot died when his plane
OL,7,Fcrashed "immediately after take-off",
OL,8,Faccording to investigators.
OL,10,FThe man, from Leeds, was killed in the
OL,11,Fcrash at an airfield near Sherburn in
OL,12,FElmet on 2 November 2025.
OL,14,FAccording to a new statement from the
OL,15,FAir Accidents Investigation Branch
OL,16,F(AAIB) on take-off the aircraft, a
OL,17,FEuropa XS, G-BZNY, "pitched up into a
OL,18,Fhigh nose up attitude" before it
OL,19,F"departed controlled flight and struck
OL,20,Fthe ground on the airfield".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
