OL,3,GNEWSAPilot died when plane crashed on
OL,4,Atake-off - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe AAIB said a wider investigation
OL,7,Finto the accident was "well advanced",
OL,8,Fand that the final report would be
OL,9,Fissued in due course.
